## API reference

### CommandMenu

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `placeholder:` | `String` | translated | The search field's placeholder. |
| `hotkey:` | `String` | `"k"` | ⌘ / Ctrl + this key focuses the search; `nil` turns it off. |
| `hotkey_hint:` | `String` | `"⌘K"` | Kbd at the end of the field; `nil` hides it. |
| `hints:` | `Boolean` | `true` | Show the ↑ ↓ / ↵ footer. |

### CommandGroup

`label:` - the group heading (optional).

### CommandItem

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `icon:` | `Symbol` | - | Leading icon. |
| `shortcut:` | `Array` / `String` | `[]` | Keys shown as Kbds. |
| `href:` | `String` | - | Makes it a link. |
| `value:` | `String` | the label | Sent with `appica-ui--blocks--command-menu:select`. |

## Accessibility

- The search is a labelled field ("Search commands"); the results are a `<nav>` of links and buttons, so they're
  also reachable with Tab.
- The highlight is visual (`data-active`); ↵ activates the highlighted command, which is also a real button or link.
